OL,3,GNEWSAEmergency plan for island due
OL,4,Asoon, group says
OL,5,
OL,6,FPractical advice will soon be available
OL,7,Fto help islanders be more prepared for
OL,8,Femergency disruptions, according to a
OL,9,Fmulti-agency group.
OL,11,FThe Jersey Resilience Forum said the
OL,12,FJersey Risk Register and Household
OL,13,FEmergency Plan would contain advice on
OL,14,Fsteps residents could take to prepare
OL,15,Ffor events such as severe weather and
OL,16,Fpower cuts.
OL,18,FLast week the UK launched its "Be
OL,19,FReady" campaign which encourages
OL,20,Fhouseholds to stock up on tinned food
OL,21,Fand bottled water to be prepared for
OL,22,Femergencies.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
