OL,3,GNEWSAEmergency plan for island due
OL,4,Asoon, group says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the forum said the
OL,7,Fplan for the island would be "developed
OL,8,Fspecifically for Jersey" and "designed
OL,9,Fto help people feel informed and
OL,10,Fconfident, not alarmed".
